    },
    {
      "text": "Good weekend?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 10.64,
      "end_time": 11.36
    },
    {
      "text": "It was fantastic.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 12.64,
      "end_time": 13.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, wow.",
      "speaker_name": "LA",
      "start_time": 14.64,
      "end_time": 15.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I like your jacket.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 15.919,
      "end_time": 16.84
    },
    {
      "text": "LA.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 16.84,
      "end_time": 17.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Where did you get that?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 17.12,
      "end_time": 18.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I've had it for ages.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 19.76,
      "end_time": 21.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Have you?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 22,
      "end_time": 22.6
    },
    {
      "text": "It's cool.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 22.6,
      "end_time": 23.36
    },
    {
      "text": "It wasn't from my recent trip to Vietnam.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 24.56,
      "end_time": 26.64
    },
    {
      "text": "It was.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 27.43,
      "end_time": 27.83
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 27.99,
      "end_time": 28.79
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, let's have a look where we're at.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 34.87,
      "end_time": 36.95
    },
    {
      "text": "Did Chris message back, Ellie?",
      "speaker_name": "Chris, Corvidae",
      "start_time": 54,
      "end_time": 55.44
    },
    {
      "text": "No, he hasn't.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 55.6,
      "end_time": 56.6
    },
    {
      "text": "He.",
      "speaker_name": "LA",
      "start_time": 56.6,
      "end_time": 56.92
    },
    {
      "text": "He's here.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 56.92,
      "end_time": 57.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Here.",
      "speaker_name": "LA",
      "start_time": 57.52,
      "end_time": 57.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, absolutely.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 58.16,
      "end_time": 59.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Hello.",
      "speaker_name": "LA",
      "start_time": 61.12,
      "end_time": 61.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, Chris.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 64.64,
      "end_time": 65.2
    },
    {
      "text": "How you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 65.2,
      "end_time": 65.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Got so many AIs in there.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 67.68,
      "end_time": 70.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Right, good to see everybody.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 70.72,
      "end_time": 72
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, let's get started.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 74.56,
      "end_time": 76.32
    },
    {
      "text": "So we've.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 77.12,
      "end_time": 78.08
    },
    {
      "text": "We've had a.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 78.16,
      "end_time": 78.96
    },
    {
      "text": "A bit more traction last week, so that's pretty good news.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 78.96,
      "end_time": 83.89
    },
    {
      "text": "We have another three signed NDAs that we're hoping to move forward on.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 84.69,
      "end_time": 88.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Ahmed, just to double check, have you sent any of these over for approval yet or.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 89.09,
      "end_time": 93.17
    },
    {
      "text": "Just screening them and then.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 95.97,
      "end_time": 98.05
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, cool.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 100.21,
      "end_time": 101.01
    },
    {
      "text": "So we have Azo Network, Maci Capital.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 101.01,
      "end_time": 107.41
    },
    {
      "text": "We've got a meeting with them on Friday, haven't we, Ahmed?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 108.55,
      "end_time": 110.79
    },
    {
      "text": "And then we've got another company called Go Genie, which is just rebranded to 7th element as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 110.87,
      "end_time": 117.03
    },
    {
      "text": "So we've got these three, which is good.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 117.19,
      "end_time": 120.15
    },
    {
      "text": "It was a bit of a slow week last week.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 120.95,
      "end_time": 123.75
    },
    {
      "text": "We was kind of expecting everybody to be back at work with it being almost a full week, but it was a Monday off in.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 124.07,
      "end_time": 129.43
    },
    {
      "text": "In America, it was Labor Day.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 131.11,
      "end_time": 132.95
    },
    {
      "text": "So I don't know whether that slowed things down sort of globally, but certainly wasn't as many as we were hoping for.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 133.71,
      "end_time": 139.79
    },
    {
      "text": "So the real plan, I think, is to really push ahead again this week.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 139.79,
      "end_time": 144.59
    },
    {
      "text": "We have a workflow that we've started sending out today, which will be all of the targeted stuff.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 144.67,
      "end_time": 151.71
    },
    {
      "text": "So we built a targeted list of potential buyers and that started to tick away today.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 151.71,
      "end_time": 159.55
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's a few thousand that will go out, as well as some targeted stuff.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 159.55,
      "end_time": 163.41
    },
    {
      "text": "And then we've got a newsletter which is planned for tomorrow as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 163.57,
      "end_time": 167.97
    },
    {
      "text": "So newsletter did go out last week, but like I said, it was a little bit slow across the board.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 167.97,
      "end_time": 172.61
    },
    {
      "text": "So hoping for a few more, but certainly we've got things picking back up, which is good.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 172.61,
      "end_time": 179.89
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, just.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 180.61,
      "end_time": 181.41
    },
    {
      "text": "Ahmad, do you have the links to any of these ready to go?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 181.65,
      "end_time": 185.53
    },
    {
      "text": "So we can just get approval for them if you can just ping them.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 185.53,
      "end_time": 190.67
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 190.67,
      "end_time": 191.27
    },
    {
      "text": "So they're in the tracking document.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 192.71,
      "end_time": 194.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's share it with you in there just now.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 195.27,
      "end_time": 198.07
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "Chris, Corvidae",
      "start_time": 198.63,
      "end_time": 199.19
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, so I'll just put some in the chat here as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 199.19,
      "end_time": 204.19
    },
    {
      "text": "So everybody's got access to them.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 204.19,
      "end_time": 205.75
    },
    {
      "text": "So there's a Zo.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 205.83,
      "end_time": 207.59
    },
    {
      "text": "Go Genie.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 210.79,
      "end_time": 211.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Go Genie is signed up as Net, which is a bit of strange one.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 213.11,
      "end_time": 217.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's just check that's the business.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 218.36,
      "end_time": 220.04
    },
    {
      "text": "They'Re redirecting us.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 222.92,
      "end_time": 224.44
    },
    {
      "text": "7Th element agency.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 225.16,
      "end_time": 226.68
    },
    {
      "text": "And who was the other one?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 228.6,
      "end_time": 230.6
    },
    {
      "text": "It was Mac.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 230.6,
      "end_time": 232.76
    },
    {
      "text": "I think they went direct to you.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 233.48,
      "end_time": 234.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Ahmed, do you have the link to them?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 235,
      "end_time": 236.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, yeah, I've got those.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 250.99,
      "end_time": 251.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Family office, Macai Capital.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 252.27,
      "end_time": 254.83
    },
    {
      "text": "Is that the one?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 254.99,
      "end_time": 255.79
    },
    {
      "text": "I shared it at the Capital.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 258.11,
      "end_time": 259.79
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, you got it.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 260.03,
      "end_time": 260.71
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "LA",
      "start_time": 260.71,
      "end_time": 261.15
    },
    {
      "text": "A Maci search.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 261.71,
      "end_time": 262.79
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "LA",
      "start_time": 262.79,
      "end_time": 263.31
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, brilliant.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 264.27,
      "end_time": 265.07
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, if we can get approval for those three, I don't see any problems.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 265.07,
      "end_time": 269.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe the agency more than any of them.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 269.72,
      "end_time": 272.92
    },
    {
      "text": "But they do look all right to you, Chris?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 272.92,
      "end_time": 275
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, sorry, I thought they were already in this list.",
      "speaker_name": "Chris, Corvidae",
      "start_time": 276.76,
      "end_time": 281.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Maci?",
      "speaker_name": "LA",
      "start_time": 281.48,
      "end_time": 282.2
    },
    {
      "text": "I think they did sign about two or three weeks ago, so you might have approved them already, but they went on vacation for all of August, so we have a meeting set up with them on Friday.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 284.68,
      "end_time": 297.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 300.56,
      "end_time": 301
    },
    {
      "text": "So the other one is not net leads, but the redirect goes to 7th element agency and then Azo Network.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 301,
      "end_time": 313.12
    },
    {
      "text": "So if those are both good to go, then we can set up meetings with these guys this week.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 313.6,
      "end_time": 317.68
    },
    {
      "text": "And then in terms of the other ones, we spoke to Azo and they said that the, they're not willing to come up, which is not, not too much of a worry.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 321.36,
      "end_time": 330.42
    },
    {
      "text": "But that one's definitely closed down.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 330.98,
      "end_time": 333.22
    },
    {
      "text": "And then we have, we have an ongoing conversation with Quanta, so it'd be good to get your, your, your sort of understanding on what you would like to do with these guys.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 333.22,
      "end_time": 345.22
    },
    {
      "text": "So they are obviously interesting call the day, but I think the issue that we're going to have is that they won't be able to reach the valuation that you guys are looking for.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 345.22,
      "end_time": 354.86
    },
    {
      "text": "This sort of 10 million region is sort of a VC valuation.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 354.86,
      "end_time": 358.85
    },
    {
      "text": "These guys are going to come back most likely with a, a multiple of ebitda, even if it was to be a high one or a multiple of revenue, but certainly not like a 10x.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 359.01,
      "end_time": 369.09
    },
    {
      "text": "So they are currently asking for updated forecasts.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 370.77,
      "end_time": 374.21
    },
    {
      "text": "I think we gave them forecasts.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 375.01,
      "end_time": 376.37
    },
    {
      "text": "Which are from where, Ahmed?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 376.37,
      "end_time": 377.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Are they July?",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 377.93,
      "end_time": 378.93
    },
    {
      "text": "April.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 380.69,
      "end_time": 381.09
    },
    {
      "text": "April.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 381.25,
      "end_time": 381.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "LA",
      "start_time": 381.61,
      "end_time": 382.13
    },
    {
      "text": "So I mean, if you guys feel that it's worth keeping the conversation open, I think it, they are definitely a good buyer, access to capital.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 382.95,
      "end_time": 391.83
    },
    {
      "text": "So it, it probably is worth just pushing things along, but I just don't know whether they'll be able to get to like a 10 million valuation or not.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 393.67,
      "end_time": 400.43
    },
    {
      "text": "But they're, they're interested in updated forecast.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 400.43,
      "end_time": 402.75
    },
    {
      "text": "So do you have those for.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 402.75,
      "end_time": 405.11
    },
    {
      "text": "We can build those.",
      "speaker_name": "Chris, Corvidae",
      "start_time": 405.91,
      "end_time": 406.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Chris, Corvidae",
      "start_time": 406.87,
      "end_time": 407.27
    },
    {
      "text": "Like, we catch up about that and.",
      "speaker_name": "Chris, Corvidae",
      "start_time": 407.35,
      "end_time": 410.54
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, okay.",
      "speaker_name": "LA",
      "start_time": 411.34,
      "end_time": 413.02
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, like the forecast for like both corvide and combined.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 416.06,
      "end_time": 420.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I understand.",
      "speaker_name": "Richard Lewis",
      "start_time": 420.9,
      "end_time": 421.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "LA",
      "start_time": 421.98,
      "end_time": 422.54
    },
    {
      "text": "And the balance sheet.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 422.54,
      "end_time": 423.62
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, if you can kind of split that up.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 423.62,
      "end_time": 425.98
    },
    {
      "text": "Would that be possible?",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
